# Background

CK collected surface water samples via kayak from three sites across
Puget Sound, Golden Gardens, Smith's Cove, and Alki Beach. At each site,
surface water samples were collected over both a 100m transect of
eelgrass (Zostera marina), and a 100m transect of non-eelgrass habitat.
The aim of this analyses is to compare bacterial community of the
seawater over eelgrass with non-eelgrass samples.

